<h1><a name=3D"MPIRAM_The_RAM_Parabolic_Equatio"></a> MPIRAM: The RAM Parab=
olic Equation Code in Fortran 95 </h1>
<p>
These are notes on using a version of Mike Collins' RAM PE solution for=20
long range acoustic calculations. The specific package here is=20
implemented in Fortran 95. It is directly derived from the matlab code=20
developed by Matt Dzieciuch; indeed matlab and Fortran 95 are so=20
similar, most of the adaptation to Fortran was just copy-paste from the=20
matlab. One of the main goals of the Fortran approach was to=20
parallelized the calculation using the Message Passing Interface (MPI)=20
standard, hence this package of Fortran code is named MPIRAM.
</p><p>
